%% Figure M-04, Report 4 section 3.6.4: Knowledge Index Generation State Machine
%% Drawn from Diagrams/State Machine/04_Index_Generation_Detailed.drawio
%% Code: knowledge_index_generation.status IN (PENDING, PROCESSING, READY, FAILED), migration 0019;
%% job max_attempts = 3; supersession uses failure_code INDEX_GENERATION_SUPERSEDED (migration 0021).
stateDiagram-v2
    state "Pending" as Pending
    state "Processing" as Processing
    state "Ready" as Ready
    state "Failed" as Failed
    [*] --> Pending : / register approved snapshot
    Pending : entry / retain approved snapshot identity
    Pending --> Processing : jobClaimed / begin generation
    Processing : do / index exact approved content
    Processing --> Ready : complete [manifest valid, no newer publication] / activate atomically
    Processing --> Pending : jobRescheduled [retryable, budget remains]
    Processing --> Failed : jobFailed [terminal or superseded]
    Ready : entry / retain complete manifest
    Failed : entry / retain failure reason, keep previous publication unchanged
    Ready --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
